---
interface Props { compact?: boolean; }
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---
<figure class="walkthrough-video not-prose">
  {!compact && <><p class="video-eyebrow">Watch the idea take shape</p><h2>From a shipping function to a useful report.</h2></>}
  <video controls playsinline preload="none" poster="/vgi/agents/worker-story-poster.png" aria-label="Captioned walkthrough of the VGI shipping example">
    <source src="/vgi/agents/worker-story.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    <track kind="captions" src="/vgi/agents/worker-story.vtt" srclang="en" label="English" default />
    <p><a href="/vgi/agents/worker-story.mp4">Download the walkthrough</a>.</p>
  </video>
  <figcaption>A short, captioned walkthrough. The animation explains the request path; the tables show recorded SQL results from the runnable example. No audio is required.</figcaption>
  <details><summary>Read the video transcript</summary><p>The order table has revenue and product costs, but shipping logic lives in application code. A VGI worker exposes that code as a typed SQL function. DuckDB sends destination and weight columns to the worker and receives shipping quotes. Therefore, one query can calculate margins and find loss-making orders. But a missing quote is not free shipping, so that order stays in the review queue. Choose your language and coding agent. The VGI skill helps the agent build the worker, run actual SQL tests, and repair failures. You keep the source and tests.</p></details>
</figure>
<style>
  .walkthrough-video { margin:0; color:var(--color-soil-900); }.video-eyebrow { font-size:.8rem; font-weight:600; color:var(--color-sun-700); margin:0 0 .65rem; }.walkthrough-video h2 { font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem); margin:0 0 1.4rem; line-height:1.3; }.walkthrough-video video { display:block; width:100%; aspect-ratio:1280/900; border-radius:.75rem; border:1px solid var(--color-soil-300); background:var(--color-rock-900); }.walkthrough-video figcaption, .walkthrough-video details { font-size:.8rem; line-height:1.7; margin-top:1rem; color:var(--color-soil-600); }.walkthrough-video summary { cursor:pointer; }.walkthrough-video details p { max-width:85ch; }
</style>
